  "description": "Yang Seung-jo, 35, can live a normal life with just 3 hours of sleep a day.\n\nHe spent the extra 5 hours he had left over for himself, and in the meantime, he was able to spend time with his loving wife and children, and with a great job and colleagues. However, when he woke up on his 36th birthday, his life was greatly distorted...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sleepingman)",
